    <item>
      <title>[신문으로 배우는 실용한자] 체벌(體罰)</title>
      <link>https://www.chosun.com/national/nie/chinese_character/2026/08/07/TBXEUYKS3ZCK5EJLXZ4OQ2XWPE/</link>
